{"id":"f7c2116a-c2c1-41b0-a81f-b9efd1c8eb8c","revision":0,"last_node_id":204,"last_link_id":12,"nodes":[{"id":7,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,60],"size":[620,600],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 文生人声 · 无数据表版 (IndexTTS-2.5 + Qwen 情绪)\n\n**引擎**: IndexTTS-2.5\n**情绪模型**: `qwen0.6bemo4-merge`（Qwen 情绪编码）\n\n### 这一版和 md 表版的区别\n数据表节点已移除，改为三个官方文本框直接给值：\n\n| 文本框 | 接到哪里 |\n|--------|----------|\n| **内容** | `UnifiedTTSTextNode` 的 `text` |\n| **情绪** | `QwenEmotionNode` 的 `emotion_text` |\n| **文件名前缀** | `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix` |\n\n### 参数要点\n- **内容**：直接写要读出来的台词；用 `[角色名]` 可切换不同音色\n- **情绪**：用自然语言描述音色与状态（年龄/性别/气息/语速/停顿），写得越具体越稳\n- **音色**：`narrator_voice` 默认 `voices_examples/male/male_01.wav`，可从下拉换\n- **长文本**：`enable_chunking` 已开，`max_chars_per_chunk` 400，过长会自动分段\n\n### 链路\n文本框 → Qwen 情绪编码 → IndexTTS 引擎 → TTS 合成 → 试听 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n产物落在 `output/0063_文生人声/` 下。\n要「用某个已有声音去念新台词」，请用 `0064_参考人声`。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 文生人声 · 无数据表版 (IndexTTS-2.5 + Qwen 情绪)\n\n**引擎**: IndexTTS-2.5\n**情绪模型**: `qwen0.6bemo4-merge`（Qwen 情绪编码）\n\n### 这一版和 md 表版的区别\n数据表节点已移除，改为三个官方文本框直接给值：\n\n| 文本框 | 接到哪里 |\n|--------|----------|\n| **内容** | `UnifiedTTSTextNode` 的 `text` |\n| **情绪** | `QwenEmotionNode` 的 `emotion_text` |\n| **文件名前缀** | `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix` |\n\n### 参数要点\n- **内容**：直接写要读出来的台词；用 `[角色名]` 可切换不同音色\n- **情绪**：用自然语言描述音色与状态（年龄/性别/气息/语速/停顿），写得越具体越稳\n- **音色**：`narrator_voice` 默认 `voices_examples/male/male_01.wav`，可从下拉换\n- **长文本**：`enable_chunking` 已开，`max_chars_per_chunk` 400，过长会自动分段\n\n### 链路\n文本框 → Qwen 情绪编码 → IndexTTS 引擎 → TTS 合成 → 试听 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n产物落在 `output/0063_文生人声/` 下。\n要「用某个已有声音去念新台词」，请用 `0064_参考人声`。"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":201,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[760,350],"size":[420,240],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[2]}],"title":"内容 (要读的文字)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"value":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。\n乍暖还寒时候，最难将息。\n三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！\n雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n\n满地黄花堆积，憔悴损，如今有谁堪摘？\n守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑！\n梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。\n这次第，怎一个愁字了得！"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。\n乍暖还寒时候，最难将息。\n三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！\n雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n\n满地黄花堆积，憔悴损，如今有谁堪摘？\n守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑！\n梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。\n这次第，怎一个愁字了得！"}},{"id":202,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[760,60],"size":[420,240],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[3]}],"title":"情绪","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","cnr_id":"comfy-core","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"value":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[""],"widgets_values_named":{"value":""}},{"id":8,"type":"QwenEmotionNode","pos":[1240,60],"size":[380,200],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"qwen_model","name":"qwen_model","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"qwen_model"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"emotion_text","name":"emotion_text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"emotion_text"},"link":3}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"emotion_control","name":"emotion_control","type":"EMOTION_CONTROL","links":[10]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"QwenEmotionNode","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"qwen_model":true,"emotion_text":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["qwen0.6bemo4-merge",""],"widgets_values_named":{"qwen_model":"qwen0.6bemo4